                                { "@type": "Question", "name": "Are Pattaya's beaches any good?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Pattaya Beach itself is mediocre. Jomtien is considerably better, and Koh Larn, 7 km offshore, has genuinely lovely turquoise water and white sand. For beaches, the Andaman coast serves you better." } }
