                                { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does a hotel cost in Pattaya?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "฿500–1,000 budget, ฿1,200–2,500 for a good 3–4 star with pool, ฿3,500–8,000 for beachfront five-star. Monthly condo rentals run ฿12,000–25,000. Cheaper than Phuket or Samui for equivalent quality." } }
